 "**\"Gulool Ja, son of Zoraal Ja\"** stays the boy's display name, as content_7_0_part3 has it, with \"King Gulool Ja\" and \"The young king\" (M954m) as aliases: the accepted 6.55 text names \"Gulool Ja Ja\", and the leak lint matches names as substrings, so an entry named \"Gulool Ja\" would read as visible inside it. Text elsewhere still says \"Gulool Ja\".",
